  "releaseNotes": "1.3.5 - Rebuild with new extension methods for Base64 encoding and decoding.\n\t\t\t1.3.4 - Rebuild with support for dates outside standard Unix epoch range.\n\t\t\t1.3.3 - Rebuild with added HTML and URL encode and decode methods.\n\t\t\t1.3.2 - Rebuild with reusable retry strategy.\n\t\t\t1.3.1 - Rebuild with updated utility extensions.\n\t\t\t1.3.0 - Rebuild with updated duration computation.\n\t\t\t1.2.3 - Fix logger message templates.\n\t\t\t1.2.2 - Loggers are non-nullable.\n\t\t\t1.2.1 - Rebuild with updated interfaces.\n\t\t\t1.2.0 - Implement new interfaces for user and group role management.\n\t\t\t1.1.4 - Rebuild with Unix epoch extension methods.\n\t\t\t1.1.3 - Rebuild with geographic coordinate obfuscation.\n\t\t\t1.1.2 - Rebuild with configurable retry strategy to HTTP requests.\n\t\t\t1.1.1 - Rebuild with default timestamp for service result.\n\t\t\t1.1.0 - Initial revision, targetting .NET 8",
